  "details": "Now we have no method that accesses to avatar information.\nsometimes, it needs avatar information.\nex) roller coaster is limited by height for viewing and flavor.\nex2) buoyancy needs a boundary to calculate the volume.\nex3) show notice to the very poor avatar for party world with an event.\nPlease add below to VRCPlayerApi:\n- GetAvatarBoundary()\n- GetAvatarAvatarPerformance()\n- GetAvatarXXXCount() ; XXX means lights, meshes, or something.\nNote: They are never return references. we need just value.",
